# Troll

## Lore

Trolls are vindictive, foul-hearted giants who hate humans, Elves and every handsome humanoid - intelligent, cunning predators of smaller beings who look like huge hairy corpses, pale white or grey and blotched with darker grey and purple, with great canine fangs in the lower jaw and molars for crushing bone. They love hand to hand combat. Their ferocity lets them deal on friendly terms with most non-humans, Dwarves included, though they like Kobolds best of all.

Perhaps a hundred live on Rifts Earth, mostly in remote wilderness where they can prey on low-tech peoples; now and then one turns up in the ''Burbs as the leader of a street gang and king of a neighborhood.

**Alignment:** Any, but leans toward Anarchist (25%), Miscreant (35%) and Diabolic (35%).

**Size:** 9 to 14 feet. **Weight:** 300 to 700 pounds.

**Average Life Span:** 120 years.

## GM Notes

Trolls prey on other humanoids and enjoy torture and bloodshed. They love Vibro-Blades, magic items, traditional blades and Mega-Damage weapons and armor, and have adapted to energy weapons and basic technology. Traditional enemies are humans, Elves, Dwarves, Gnomes, Changelings and anything beautiful; allies are Kobolds, Goblins, Orcs and Giants, and on Rifts Earth other ugly non-humans and monsters, though they are leery of supernatural beings.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'rifts-troll');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'rifts-troll';

